  "title": "Why avoiding socks in summers is against your health?",
  "summary": "Shoes without socks plus hot Indian weather is the perfect combo for stinky feet. Sweat causes bacterial growth and nasty odour. Even premium branded shoes without socks leave wounds, rashes and blisters to our feet due to friction between them. Socks protect your feet from dirt, pollution, tanning and heat in summers.",
